  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to the completion of work.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the commencement of works, details shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority for the storage and collection of refuse or waste.  The arrangement for storing of refuse or waste shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation herby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to the commencement of works, details shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority showing that the existing vent can be positioned 1m above any new openable window.  The positioning of this vent shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation herby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 6 - The access doorway to the shop shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level."
  ],
